WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 1]

01:38.025 --> 01:40.195
[University Library]

01:51.620 --> 01:53.700
Professor Ye, I updated my thesis again.

01:53.720 --> 01:55.160
I know you don't like
to read e-materials.

01:55.180 --> 01:57.060
Leave it over there.
I'll review it later.

01:59.180 --> 02:00.300
Professor Ye,

02:00.340 --> 02:01.620
is Fan Xian dead or not?

02:01.620 --> 02:04.195
[Professor Ye, Lecturer]

02:18.180 --> 02:21.040
Professor Ye, you have to attend
the academic exchange conference tomorrow.

02:21.060 --> 02:22.820
You can't just keep avoiding it.

02:23.180 --> 02:24.660
Got it. Thank you.

02:34.340 --> 02:35.760
By the way, Professor Ye,

02:35.780 --> 02:37.580
is Fan Xian dead or not?

03:10.500 --> 03:11.440
Do you need anything?

03:11.460 --> 03:14.700
Professor Ye, is Fan Xian really dead?

03:25.500 --> 03:27.140
Are you done with your thesis?

03:27.180 --> 03:29.540
Not yet. I'm still brainstorming.

03:34.460 --> 03:35.020
Professor Ye...

03:35.020 --> 03:36.580
I don't know!

03:37.340 --> 03:38.860
What do you mean?

03:43.340 --> 03:44.540
Zhang Qing?

03:44.580 --> 03:45.660
It's me.

03:46.060 --> 03:47.700
You've finally appeared.

03:47.940 --> 03:49.140
What did I do?

03:50.300 --> 03:51.620
Is Fan Xian dead or not?

03:51.620 --> 03:52.460
[Zhang Qing, Undergraduate Student]

03:52.460 --> 03:54.000
Everyone has been asking me
the same question

03:54.000 --> 03:55.660
ever since you delayed your submission.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.440
How did Fan Xian end up
after lying on the ground?

03:57.460 --> 03:58.560
Is he dead or not?

03:58.580 --> 03:59.460
If he's not,

03:59.460 --> 04:01.160
what should he do after that?

04:01.180 --> 04:02.440
I already completed it.

04:02.460 --> 04:04.580
I wanted you to be the first reader.

04:08.060 --> 04:10.980
I remember that Fan Xian was stabbed by someone

04:11.300 --> 04:13.000
before you stopped your submission.

04:13.020 --> 04:14.000
It was Yan Bingyun.

04:14.020 --> 04:15.300
So, is he dead or not?

04:16.340 --> 04:17.480
Professor Ye,

04:17.500 --> 04:19.460
the library will be closed soon.

04:29.950 --> 04:37.950
[Joy of Life Season 2]

04:45.500 --> 04:46.700
You had one whole night to consider it.

04:46.700 --> 04:47.900
[Sifang Keep, the Border of Qing State]

04:47.900 --> 04:49.420
What's your decision?

04:50.260 --> 04:51.860
It's not my decision.

04:52.460 --> 04:54.340
Now, it's your decision.

04:54.380 --> 04:55.780
Ask yourself this.

04:57.260 --> 04:58.480
Are you confident

04:58.500 --> 05:00.340
that you can slay me here?

05:03.020 --> 05:03.905
Mr. Fan!

05:03.925 --> 05:06.320
[Fan Xian]

05:13.580 --> 05:14.080
This...

05:14.080 --> 05:15.580
[Yan Bingyun,
Imperial Inspectorate Fourth Division]

05:15.580 --> 05:17.300
is my decision.

05:31.380 --> 05:33.920
If so, is Fan Xian dead or not?

05:33.940 --> 05:35.720
How could the main character die here?

05:35.720 --> 05:36.580
[The Capital of Qing State]

05:36.580 --> 05:38.360
Your Majesty!

05:38.380 --> 05:41.240
Your Majesty, we're in huge trouble!

05:41.260 --> 05:45.460
Your Majesty, Fan Xian is dead!

05:47.780 --> 05:50.460
Your Majesty!

05:52.020 --> 05:55.020
We're in huge trouble!

06:06.500 --> 06:07.970
[Imperial Inspectorate]

06:20.460 --> 06:21.540
Chief!

06:22.700 --> 06:23.680
Chief!

06:23.700 --> 06:24.800
Hurry! Forget about me!

06:24.820 --> 06:27.360
Gather all members
of the Imperial Inspectorate right now.

06:27.380 --> 06:27.780
Hurry!

06:27.780 --> 06:28.600
Yes, sir!

06:28.620 --> 06:29.700
Go now!

06:43.375 --> 06:47.995
[Fan Xian is dead.]

06:51.020 --> 06:53.240
According to the diplomatic corps,

06:53.260 --> 06:55.440
Fan Xian was stricken
by terminal illness!

06:55.460 --> 06:57.920
He died on his way back to the Capital!

06:57.940 --> 07:02.220
His body has already been cremated!

07:02.820 --> 07:06.700
Summon Chen Pingping!

07:16.580 --> 07:17.660
What's wrong?

07:18.820 --> 07:19.560
What's going on?

07:19.580 --> 07:21.020
I don't know.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.780
What's happening?

07:29.060 --> 07:31.340
Chief, what happened?

07:33.375 --> 07:35.360
[Chen Pingping,
Chief of Imperial Inspectorate]

07:35.380 --> 07:36.480
Fan Xian is dead.

07:36.480 --> 07:38.580
[Yan Ruohai, Division Supervisor
of Imperial Inspectorate Fourth Division]

07:38.580 --> 07:40.460
The world might be flipped upside down.

07:40.580 --> 07:42.100
You all should wait here.

07:42.260 --> 07:43.540
Wait for my updates.

08:49.950 --> 08:51.995
[Fan Jian, Minister of Revenue]

09:12.900 --> 09:14.900
Where's the body of my son?

09:15.660 --> 09:17.020
I don't know.

09:17.380 --> 09:18.900
You don't know?

09:19.900 --> 09:22.180
How can you not know about it?

09:23.220 --> 09:25.200
You made him
take over the Imperial Inspectorate!

09:25.220 --> 09:28.200
You were the ones who forced him
to go Northern Qi as a diplomat!

09:28.220 --> 09:29.660
And you were the ones

09:30.380 --> 09:32.420
who told the Black Cavalries
to withdraw!

09:33.020 --> 09:35.380
That's why his life was in danger!

09:38.260 --> 09:40.140
Now that he's dead,

09:40.780 --> 09:42.260
all you have

09:42.780 --> 09:44.420
to tell me

09:45.540 --> 09:47.140
is that you don't know anything, huh?

09:52.740 --> 09:54.740
You all are abandoning him.

09:55.100 --> 09:56.540
But I won't!

09:58.780 --> 10:00.820
I'm going to bring my son home!

10:01.140 --> 10:03.300
Return my son to me!

10:06.220 --> 10:08.300
I've hidden him all my life.

10:09.980 --> 10:12.140
I can't just let him

10:12.220 --> 10:14.500
suffer a wrongful death.

10:15.420 --> 10:17.180
He's a human,

10:17.620 --> 10:19.420
not a pawn!

10:24.300 --> 10:26.200
I'll pay for it with my life.

10:26.220 --> 10:28.520
Fine! Die right now!

10:28.540 --> 10:29.620
No.

10:30.620 --> 10:31.700
Why?

10:32.100 --> 10:33.540
Are you afraid of death?

10:36.140 --> 10:37.780
My life alone

10:39.420 --> 10:40.900
won't suffice.

10:43.140 --> 10:46.140
Before my death, I will serve justice

10:46.500 --> 10:48.620
to both good and evildoers.

10:49.900 --> 10:51.660
I will take away the lives

10:51.860 --> 10:53.780
of those who deserve to die.

11:03.860 --> 11:07.020
Sirs, please don't argue here.

11:08.380 --> 11:10.300
Where's His Majesty?

11:10.620 --> 11:12.260
His Majesty isn't seeing anyone.

11:14.020 --> 11:15.720
Wasn't His Majesty the one
who summoned me?

11:15.740 --> 11:17.140
That's right.

11:17.420 --> 11:21.480
His Majesty was deeply disheartened
by Mr. Fan's death.

11:21.500 --> 11:24.200
That's why he summoned you
in a hurry, Mr. Chen.

11:24.220 --> 11:26.000
So, what should we do now?

11:26.020 --> 11:27.300
Now?

11:27.620 --> 11:29.980
He kept quiet after reading

11:29.980 --> 11:32.260
the second letter delivered
by the messenger pigeon.

11:32.380 --> 11:34.420
He doesn't wish to see anyone now.

11:35.260 --> 11:37.140
The second letter?

11:45.925 --> 11:48.045
[Second Prince's Residence]

12:05.125 --> 12:07.495
[Li Chengze, Second Prince]

12:09.440 --> 12:10.540
Your Highness!

12:11.325 --> 12:13.245
[Fan Wujiu,
the Bodyguard of Second Prince]

12:25.900 --> 12:27.180
It's top secret.

12:27.440 --> 12:28.860
It's Xie Bi'an's messenger pigeon.

12:28.880 --> 12:30.360
That means it's related to Fan Xian.

12:30.380 --> 12:31.500
Read it for me.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.020
But...

12:32.020 --> 12:33.100
It's fine.

12:33.260 --> 12:34.620
I trust you.

12:39.980 --> 12:42.540
His Majesty told me
to deliver this to you.

12:48.140 --> 12:49.740
Yan Bingyun?

12:49.800 --> 12:51.575
[Yan Bingyun stabbed
Mr. Fan from his back]

12:51.575 --> 12:52.620
[so as to kill him on the spot]

12:52.620 --> 12:54.880
It's your man,
a member of the Imperial Inspectorate.

13:24.940 --> 13:26.420
I never expected Fan Xian

13:26.780 --> 13:28.780
to die just like that.

13:30.040 --> 13:31.900
Fan Xian was going against His Highness.

13:31.940 --> 13:34.220
He would definitely
plunge the Qing State into chaos.

13:34.780 --> 13:36.300
There was no feud between us.

13:36.775 --> 13:37.940
I only killed him

13:38.320 --> 13:39.260
for the sake of the Qing State.

13:39.260 --> 13:40.300
For the sake of the Qing State, huh?

13:40.300 --> 13:41.480
[Xie Bi'an,
the Bodyguard of Second Prince]

13:41.480 --> 13:42.840
If so, why are you cremating his body?

13:42.860 --> 13:44.200
Fei Jie is his master.

13:44.220 --> 13:46.720
Elder Fei's medical skills are on par
with his poison techniques.

13:46.740 --> 13:47.560
When Fan Xian dies,

13:47.580 --> 13:49.100
he'll surely examine his body.

13:49.120 --> 13:52.200
I wouldn't be able to cover up the fact
if he found out that he died of a stab wound.

13:52.380 --> 13:56.080
However, how can you explain yourself
to the people without a body?

13:56.100 --> 13:57.883
I can just say that he was unable

13:57.883 --> 14:01.140
to adapt to the local conditions
and died of terminal illness.

14:07.900 --> 14:11.140
Xie Bi'an said Fan Xian was dead
and that his body has been cremated.

14:12.500 --> 14:14.140
Did Xie Bi'an kill him?

14:14.860 --> 14:15.940
No.

14:16.220 --> 14:17.800
Yan Bingyun stabbed him from the back.

14:17.820 --> 14:18.960
His sneak attack was a success.

14:18.980 --> 14:20.780
Yan Bingyun killed Fan Xian?

14:37.300 --> 14:39.020
His body has been cremated indeed.

14:42.900 --> 14:43.980
Why?

14:44.500 --> 14:45.780
You don't trust me?

14:47.140 --> 14:48.220
That's not it.

14:48.980 --> 14:50.740
I'm just trying

14:52.260 --> 14:54.140
to take a keepsake here.

15:01.020 --> 15:03.120
Why would Yan Bingyun attack him?

15:03.140 --> 15:04.520
You think something's off too?

15:04.540 --> 15:08.060
Yan Bingyun always acts
for the sake of the Qing State.

15:08.300 --> 15:10.640
He reveres law the most.

15:10.660 --> 15:12.420
With Fan Xian's position,

15:12.420 --> 15:14.140
no matter what happens,

15:14.160 --> 15:17.920
Yan Bingyun should have brought him
back to the Capital for interrogation.

15:17.980 --> 15:20.140
Why would he kill him?

15:20.780 --> 15:23.380
It's illogical for the Tiger Guards
to relay the message either.

15:23.500 --> 15:24.660
You're right.

15:25.260 --> 15:28.500
The Tiger Guards are protecting Fan Xian
under His Majesty's order.

15:28.860 --> 15:30.960
If Yan Bingyun did kill him,

15:30.980 --> 15:33.300
Gao Da would've arrested him.

15:34.260 --> 15:37.380
It's unfathomable
that he'd send such news back.

15:47.780 --> 15:50.660
Could it be that something's wrong
with the news?

15:52.780 --> 15:54.020
Could it be

15:55.020 --> 15:56.420
that he faked his death?

15:58.020 --> 15:59.420
That's possible.

15:59.860 --> 16:02.000
Why did that brat fake his death?

16:02.020 --> 16:04.600
Say, why do you think he did so?

16:04.620 --> 16:06.660
The reason no longer matters.

16:06.780 --> 16:08.300
Right now, Fan Xian

16:09.980 --> 16:12.020
is beyond redemption.

16:14.860 --> 16:16.140
You mean His Majesty?

16:16.980 --> 16:19.060
He deceived the ruler.

16:23.420 --> 16:26.180
This can't be.
Fan Xian wouldn't die that easily.

16:26.500 --> 16:27.020
However,

16:27.020 --> 16:28.580
this is indeed Xie Bi'an's handwriting.

16:28.600 --> 16:30.760
What would I do if I were Fan Xian?

16:32.300 --> 16:34.020
I would fake my death and escape.

16:34.980 --> 16:36.120
Where can he go?

16:36.140 --> 16:37.540
The Capital, naturally.

16:37.620 --> 16:39.780
He's too sentimental.

16:40.020 --> 16:41.740
He wishes to deceive the world
and hide his tracks.

16:41.740 --> 16:42.880
It's a shame

16:42.900 --> 16:45.300
that I could recognize him
even if he was reduced to ashes.

16:46.780 --> 16:47.840
What is this?

16:47.860 --> 16:49.260
The ash of Fan Xian.

16:51.800 --> 16:52.460
Where are you going?

16:52.480 --> 16:53.840
To see His Majesty
and plead for his mercy.

16:53.840 --> 16:55.000
He didn't want to see anyone just now.

16:55.020 --> 16:56.820
It's the same
even if you go there again.

16:59.140 --> 17:00.780
What should I do, then?

17:04.820 --> 17:06.740
Should we suppress the news of his death

17:06.780 --> 17:08.000
and keep it down?

17:08.020 --> 17:09.220
Quite the opposite.

17:10.220 --> 17:11.820
We have to escalate this matter.

17:12.340 --> 17:15.020
Fan Xian's death has to be valuable.

17:16.340 --> 17:19.200
Your Highness, how could you
be so sure that Fan Xian isn't dead?

17:19.220 --> 17:20.300
Wujiu,

17:20.580 --> 17:22.380
have I ever been wrong
about someone?

17:24.020 --> 17:25.260
But he was killed and cremated

17:25.260 --> 17:26.860
in public.

17:27.340 --> 17:28.680
How could he possibly escape?

17:28.700 --> 17:30.820
I have no idea.
I can't see through his tricks.

17:31.360 --> 17:32.980
But that's what we call a surprise.

17:34.460 --> 17:36.260
That's Fan Xian for you.

17:53.300 --> 17:55.745
[Gao Da, the Leader of Tiger Guards]

18:04.160 --> 18:05.280
You can have it back.

18:05.300 --> 18:07.020
Let me examine this sword.

18:08.050 --> 18:10.345
[Wang Qinian, the Secretary
of Imperial Inspectorate]

18:14.840 --> 18:16.380
Where did the blood come from?

18:17.580 --> 18:19.400
We can't just let it die for nothing,
don't you think?

18:19.420 --> 18:21.460
Mr. Fan, here you go.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.440
It's chicken blood.

18:22.460 --> 18:23.540
Chicken blood?

18:26.460 --> 18:27.800
So you predicted the incident, huh?

18:27.820 --> 18:29.580
You knew that this would happen today.

18:29.660 --> 18:31.000
I just have plenty of friends.

18:31.020 --> 18:31.920
What do you mean?

18:31.940 --> 18:33.100
My seniors from the Third Division

18:33.100 --> 18:35.860
gave me plenty of toys
before I left the Capital.

18:38.300 --> 18:39.380
Wait!

18:39.660 --> 18:40.820
Wait!

18:40.980 --> 18:42.540
Xian, wait!

18:45.580 --> 18:47.460
Xian, follow me.

18:48.060 --> 18:49.300
Come.

18:50.680 --> 18:51.820
What's the matter?

18:52.260 --> 18:53.860
You two, keep guard over here.

18:57.180 --> 18:58.540
What are you thinking?

18:59.220 --> 19:00.240
Here, hold this.

19:00.260 --> 19:02.500
I have something important
that I must give to you.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.320
What is this?

19:10.340 --> 19:11.420
Look.

19:11.780 --> 19:12.860
Isn't it fun?

19:13.300 --> 19:15.560
The tip of the sword enters from there
and exits from the other end.

19:15.580 --> 19:16.900
There's a blood sack inside.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.940
You can control
the volume of blood you spill.

19:18.980 --> 19:20.380
This is quite interesting.

19:20.540 --> 19:21.960
You're going to our rival state.

19:21.980 --> 19:23.200
It's filled with dangers.

19:23.220 --> 19:25.860
If nothing works out,
at least you can "die", you know?

19:36.220 --> 19:38.000
Who would've expected us

19:38.020 --> 19:39.520
to use it in our own state

19:39.540 --> 19:41.480
instead of Northern Qi?

19:41.500 --> 19:42.940
Your face is still dirty.

19:43.100 --> 19:45.740
He did it on purpose so that he
could brag about his hard work.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.000
Not at all.

19:47.020 --> 19:48.560
Mr. Fan, for you,

19:48.580 --> 19:50.000
I'm willing to do anything.

19:50.020 --> 19:52.780
I'm willing to brave through
all kinds of dangers for you.

19:53.400 --> 19:55.240
To think that you came up
with this devious plan.

19:55.260 --> 19:56.840
You even brought a torch with you.

19:56.860 --> 19:58.160
I have no choice but to burn it.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.540
Xie Bi'an will definitely
examine it thoroughly.

20:01.460 --> 20:03.320
It's all thanks to Wang.

20:03.340 --> 20:05.080
He actually dug a tunnel below

20:05.100 --> 20:06.400
and waited for me down there.

20:06.420 --> 20:08.080
Mr. Fan, it's my honor

20:08.100 --> 20:09.580
to assist you.

20:10.540 --> 20:11.860
What about the ash?

20:11.980 --> 20:13.300
Where did you get it from?

20:14.500 --> 20:15.860
Sir, you might not know,

20:16.540 --> 20:18.000
the diplomatic corps prepared

20:18.020 --> 20:20.240
two carts' worth of food.

20:20.260 --> 20:21.520
I found

20:21.540 --> 20:24.040
half a dried pig in the cart.

20:24.060 --> 20:25.320
After I burned it,

20:25.340 --> 20:27.820
the size was about the same as Mr. Fan.

20:28.540 --> 20:30.040
Mr. Fan, my bad.

20:30.060 --> 20:31.840
I should never compare you to a pig.

20:31.860 --> 20:33.440
Oh no. That's not what I mean.

20:33.460 --> 20:34.540
Mr. Fan, if you're angry at me,

20:34.540 --> 20:36.280
you can kick me.

20:36.300 --> 20:37.020
Here.

20:37.020 --> 20:38.180
That's enough.

20:38.220 --> 20:39.720
Your acting isn't as good as Mr. Yan's.

20:39.740 --> 20:41.840
How could I compare myself to Mr. Yan?

20:41.860 --> 20:43.200
Mr. Yan acted

20:43.220 --> 20:45.220
as if it happened for real.

20:46.300 --> 20:47.820
Actually,

20:48.260 --> 20:49.740
there's still a flaw.

20:49.980 --> 20:51.260
What flaw?

20:51.500 --> 20:53.580
Reducing a body to ash
with such a temperature

20:53.580 --> 20:55.220
cannot be achieved
in such a short amount of time.

20:55.220 --> 20:56.160
But when I think about it,

20:56.180 --> 20:57.920
Xie Bi'an is a swordsman.

20:57.940 --> 20:59.220
He might not excel at cremation.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.540
This won't occur to him.

21:03.060 --> 21:04.640
Do you excel at cremation, then?

21:04.660 --> 21:06.480
Mr. Fan is good
at both cremation and cooking.

21:06.500 --> 21:09.000
I learned how to make this chicken
from him.

21:09.020 --> 21:12.020
Mr. Fan is dashing, smart,

21:12.220 --> 21:14.320
and good at everything.

21:14.340 --> 21:16.020
You sure are glib-tongued, huh?

21:18.020 --> 21:19.100
What's next?

21:19.220 --> 21:20.340
What's your plan?

21:21.860 --> 21:24.380
Teng Zijing's wife and child, Fan Sizhe,

21:24.980 --> 21:26.220
and Master,

21:27.420 --> 21:29.220
I can't rest at ease if Second Prince

21:29.240 --> 21:30.540
did hold them captive.

21:31.060 --> 21:32.340
You wish to save them?

21:33.420 --> 21:34.440
The convoy can take its time.

21:34.460 --> 21:36.120
I'll rush back to the Capital first.

21:36.820 --> 21:38.700
You're truly bold.

21:40.260 --> 21:41.780
Can I ask you something?

21:44.060 --> 21:45.140
What is it?

21:45.580 --> 21:47.780
Why did you choose to side with me?

21:47.900 --> 21:50.140
Aren't you afraid
the Qing State might be in turmoil?

21:54.460 --> 21:56.780
The Imperial Inspectorate
never feared any threats.

21:57.060 --> 21:59.580
We all act
for the sake of the Qing State.

21:59.980 --> 22:02.340
Li Chengze is the prince
of the Qing State.

22:03.260 --> 22:04.620
As the prince,

22:05.340 --> 22:07.300
he actually colluded with Northern Qi

22:07.320 --> 22:08.360
and embezzled the state funds.

22:08.380 --> 22:10.600
His intention alone is enough
for him to be executed.

22:10.860 --> 22:12.460
I'm loyal to the Qing State

22:12.660 --> 22:14.020
and His Majesty.

22:14.420 --> 22:16.060
As for the princes...

22:23.740 --> 22:24.480
Wang Qinian.

22:24.500 --> 22:25.160
Yes, Mr. Fan.

22:25.180 --> 22:27.500
Deliver a plaque to Mr. Yan after this.

22:27.940 --> 22:29.620
What should I carve on top of it?

22:29.980 --> 22:32.220
The great defender of the Qing State.

22:33.260 --> 22:34.540
Excellent title.

23:18.120 --> 23:19.540
Sir, have you heard the news
about Fan Xian?

23:19.540 --> 23:20.280
I have.

23:20.300 --> 23:21.280
Do not panic.

23:21.300 --> 23:22.060
We're far away.

23:22.080 --> 23:23.240
Maybe it's just misinformation.

23:23.260 --> 23:25.300
We can't afford to panic right now.

23:26.220 --> 23:27.760
I've already taught them a lesson.

23:27.780 --> 23:28.740
They actually intended

23:28.760 --> 23:30.480
to prepare a funeral
before the news was verified.

23:30.500 --> 23:31.860
Isn't that ridiculous?

23:31.940 --> 23:33.540
Let them proceed with the funeral.

23:33.700 --> 23:34.980
What?

23:35.220 --> 23:37.000
Proceed with the necessary steps.

23:37.020 --> 23:38.860
Take it as if he's dead for real.

23:39.260 --> 23:42.520
Sir,
you mustn't take the news seriously.

23:42.540 --> 23:44.260
[Liu Ruyu, he Female Head of the Fan Family]
He is still so young.

23:44.260 --> 23:45.960
I don't believe that he's gone.

23:45.980 --> 23:47.620
Just follow my instructions.

23:49.340 --> 23:51.180
Is there something wrong with his death?

23:53.540 --> 23:55.180
Make sure all of them grieve.

23:55.500 --> 23:56.580
Understood.

23:58.340 --> 23:59.420
By the way,

24:00.060 --> 24:01.560
you should check on Ruoruo.

24:01.580 --> 24:03.320
That child cares for Fan Xian the most.

24:03.340 --> 24:06.020
I'm afraid that she might fall sick again
due to her deep grief.

24:06.300 --> 24:08.320
Ruoruo respects Fan Xian
the most usually.

24:08.340 --> 24:10.580
I'm sure she's sobbing right now.

24:19.175 --> 24:20.945
[Fan Ruoruo, the Daughter of Fan Jian]

24:24.540 --> 24:25.940
Aunt, you're here.

24:26.540 --> 24:29.160
I just made some donkey-hide gelatin
and longan soup.

24:29.180 --> 24:30.780
Have it later, okay?

24:31.540 --> 24:33.740
Ruoruo, what are you doing?

24:35.220 --> 24:37.480
I wonder what Fan Sizhe
is busy with lately.

24:37.500 --> 24:38.800
He's ignoring the bookstore.

24:38.820 --> 24:40.340
The warehouse is damp and smelly.

24:40.360 --> 24:41.260
I couldn't take it any longer.

24:41.260 --> 24:42.920
That's why I'm drying
the books under the sun.

24:42.940 --> 24:44.760
Have you not heard of the news yet?

24:44.780 --> 24:47.040
I already heard
about my brother's death.

24:47.060 --> 24:48.140
Then...

24:49.020 --> 24:50.240
Aunt, don't worry.

24:50.260 --> 24:51.520
There's no need to be upset.

24:51.540 --> 24:53.620
Do not grieve too much, okay?

24:53.860 --> 24:55.760
Why are you the one consoling me now?

24:55.780 --> 24:57.300
It's because Xian isn't dead.

24:57.820 --> 24:59.240
Did your father speak to you just now?

24:59.260 --> 25:00.340
No, he didn't.

25:00.980 --> 25:03.000
If so, how are you so sure
that your brother is still alive?

25:03.020 --> 25:04.440
It's because Xian won't die.

25:04.460 --> 25:06.000
But all humans die.

25:06.020 --> 25:07.760
That's right, except for Xian.

25:07.780 --> 25:08.860
But why?

25:08.940 --> 25:10.460
Because I trust him.

25:11.300 --> 25:13.000
Ruoruo, is that really how you see it?

25:13.020 --> 25:14.040
Yeah.

25:14.060 --> 25:15.820
If so, I can rest at ease now.

25:15.980 --> 25:17.800
But Ruoruo, your trust in your brother,

25:17.820 --> 25:19.580
isn't it considered blind faith?

25:25.375 --> 25:27.020
[The Capital of the Qing State]

25:27.020 --> 25:28.000
Wang.

25:28.020 --> 25:29.300
We're back on your turf.

25:29.320 --> 25:30.740
You have to cover my back now.

25:31.060 --> 25:32.400
Mr. Fan, you have no idea.

25:32.420 --> 25:33.720
The newcomers took over my turf

25:33.740 --> 25:36.200
ever since I started serving you.

25:36.220 --> 25:38.860
I'm afraid that the old acquaintances
might see and recognize us.

25:41.400 --> 25:42.740
I can't believe that someone imitated me

25:42.740 --> 25:45.020
and sold their drawings here
like what I did back then.

25:45.940 --> 25:48.020
Looks like there's a demand
in the market.

25:48.180 --> 25:49.300
What market?

25:49.660 --> 25:51.200
Four liang!

25:51.220 --> 25:53.080
They're actually bidding
for drawings now?

25:53.100 --> 25:53.920
Four liang!

25:53.940 --> 25:55.560
Five liang!

25:55.580 --> 25:57.020
Five liang?

25:57.540 --> 25:58.760
Hey! Let me take a look!

25:58.780 --> 26:00.840
What kind of drawing
actually cost five liang?

26:05.180 --> 26:06.300
Is this it?

26:07.860 --> 26:10.000
People nowadays
can be scammed this easily, huh?

26:10.020 --> 26:11.240
Don't stir up trouble.

26:11.260 --> 26:12.740
This is so infuriating.

26:16.340 --> 26:17.580
Go back!

26:19.580 --> 26:20.240
What are they doing?

26:20.260 --> 26:21.340
They're all praying to the dead.

26:21.340 --> 26:23.300
Let's go and pray too.

26:26.580 --> 26:28.780
Here, line up
and get your incense sticks.

26:29.420 --> 26:30.940
Give me one too.

26:31.020 --> 26:31.800
Here you go.

26:31.820 --> 26:34.400
Line up and get your incense sticks.
Everyone should pray to him.

26:35.260 --> 26:37.920
Why is no one taking note
of this funeral outside the city?

26:37.940 --> 26:40.060
And everyone is participating in it too.

26:40.460 --> 26:42.680
This family must be very influential.

26:42.700 --> 26:44.020
Indeed.

26:45.780 --> 26:50.340
In this world of turmoil,
no poetry can surpass it.

26:50.540 --> 26:55.220
Many have lamented
the emptiness of unfulfilled love.

26:56.020 --> 26:57.580
These two sentences
aren't related at all.

26:57.580 --> 26:58.860
That's right.

26:58.980 --> 27:01.160
Plus, it's quite a bold statement too.

27:01.180 --> 27:02.000
Mr. Fan, with you around,

27:02.020 --> 27:03.240
how dare they say things like:

27:03.260 --> 27:05.040
"No poetry can surpass it?"

27:05.060 --> 27:06.080
Don't spout nonsense.

27:06.100 --> 27:07.280
Respect the dead.

27:07.300 --> 27:09.520
Lamented
the emptiness of unfulfilled love?

27:09.540 --> 27:12.020
Seems like this talented individual
is quite sentimental.

27:12.780 --> 27:15.540
Is there someone like that
in the Capital?

27:16.500 --> 27:17.860
I'll go and take a look.

27:20.260 --> 27:24.820
In this world of turmoil,
no poetry can surpass it.

27:25.420 --> 27:28.640
The Memorial Tablet of Fan Anzhi,
the Pillar of the Qing State?

27:28.660 --> 27:30.780
His surname is also Fan.
Who's Fan Anzhi?

27:31.500 --> 27:33.020
It's me.

27:33.540 --> 27:35.700
Mr. Fan, is your other name
actually Anzhi?

27:36.580 --> 27:38.520
Do you think it's someone
who bore the same name?

27:38.540 --> 27:39.520
Come.

27:39.540 --> 27:41.960
Queue up. Follow me.

27:41.980 --> 27:43.800
Everyone, please look.

27:43.820 --> 27:45.400
There's a tale at this very spot.

27:45.420 --> 27:48.840
Mr. Fan Xian descended from the horse
at this very spot

27:48.860 --> 27:50.540
when he first came to the Capital.

27:50.540 --> 27:51.660
He mourned the past by the roadside.

27:51.660 --> 27:53.480
I thought you came here in a carriage.

27:53.500 --> 27:55.040
After that, he met his beloved here.

27:55.060 --> 27:57.200
And a beautiful story
between the two was ensued.

27:57.220 --> 27:59.160
Everyone,
the spring exam is approaching.

27:59.180 --> 28:00.640
If you pray here,

28:00.660 --> 28:02.760
not only will you pass your exam,

28:02.780 --> 28:05.280
but you'll also receive
a loving relationship.

28:05.300 --> 28:06.900
Hurry!

28:06.920 --> 28:09.100
You won't be able to get married
if you don't pray here.

28:09.780 --> 28:11.680
You're actually
praying for a relationship?

28:11.700 --> 28:13.720
Mr. Fan, calm down.

28:13.740 --> 28:14.760
I'll tear it down.

28:14.780 --> 28:16.400
Don't. It's your own memorial tablet
after all.

28:16.420 --> 28:17.080
It's bad luck

28:17.100 --> 28:18.080
for you to damage it.

28:18.100 --> 28:19.680
What are they thinking?

28:19.700 --> 28:21.580
I don't know either.

28:26.375 --> 28:29.195
[The Memorial Tablet of Fan Anzhi,
the Pillar of the Qing State]

28:30.700 --> 28:32.780
It's as lively as Chinese New Year.

28:33.500 --> 28:35.060
I do live up to my reputation, huh?

28:35.420 --> 28:36.040
Take a look.

28:36.060 --> 28:37.280
Everyone, check this out.

28:37.300 --> 28:41.000
Mr. Fan Xian once drank liquor and tea
and recited poems here.

28:41.020 --> 28:41.720
Come.

28:41.740 --> 28:42.500
Only ten sets left.

28:42.500 --> 28:43.940
- This is the last chance!
- Mr. Fan, is that true?

28:43.940 --> 28:45.780
This is the last chance!

28:47.020 --> 28:50.020
Mr. Fan's personal signature.
It's a relic.

28:50.020 --> 28:51.520
The handwriting is pretty good.

28:51.540 --> 28:52.680
Burgers for sale!

28:52.700 --> 28:55.500
Mr. Fan's invention, burgers,
for sale here!

28:56.180 --> 28:57.380
Look, burgers.

28:58.060 --> 29:00.160
Burgers meant for all, huh?

29:00.180 --> 29:02.420
Sir, this is the same
as Mr. Fan's perfumed sachet.

29:02.420 --> 29:03.200
Do you want one?

29:03.220 --> 29:04.580
What's with the five-spice duck smell?

29:04.580 --> 29:05.780
Sir, what are you talking about?

29:05.780 --> 29:07.260
Why would Mr. Fan's perfumed sachet

29:07.260 --> 29:08.260
smell like five-spice duck?

29:08.260 --> 29:10.540
Sir, this is a collection of Mr. Fan's poems.
Do you want to buy it?

29:10.560 --> 29:11.460
You don't want this?

29:11.480 --> 29:12.980
We have a better collection.

29:13.500 --> 29:14.480
"Red Mansion."

29:14.500 --> 29:15.580
This is the ending.

29:15.580 --> 29:16.680
The ending is out?

29:16.700 --> 29:17.420
What ending?

29:17.420 --> 29:18.580
"Red Mansion" isn't over yet.

29:18.580 --> 29:19.960
Who are you trying to deceive?

29:19.980 --> 29:20.480
Not over yet...

29:20.500 --> 29:20.820
You!

29:20.820 --> 29:22.080
It's not over.

29:22.100 --> 29:23.040
It's not over yet.

29:23.060 --> 29:25.100
You penniless scum!
I'm sure you can't afford it!

29:25.100 --> 29:28.280
[Mr. Fan's secret formula One liang per bottle]
This is the poison Mr. Fan invented before his passing.

29:28.300 --> 29:30.680
It gets rid of all pests!

29:30.700 --> 29:33.740
Don't sell poison.

29:33.800 --> 29:36.200
[Selling The Immortal Poet's Unique Brew
To Commemorate His Ingenuity]

29:36.220 --> 29:38.000
Fresh yogurt for sale.

29:38.020 --> 29:40.160
It's delicious
and there are plenty of flavors!

29:40.180 --> 29:41.980
Mr. Fan Xian frequented our stall
before his death.

29:41.980 --> 29:44.020
He praised them highly.
Here, take a look.

29:44.580 --> 29:45.440
Mr. Fan,

29:45.460 --> 29:47.380
when will you get me some of that?

29:47.400 --> 29:48.340
You'll get plenty of yogurt

29:48.340 --> 29:49.320
when I'm revived.

29:49.340 --> 29:51.700
Mr. Fan, your fake death on our way back

29:51.780 --> 29:53.840
was a secret.

29:53.860 --> 29:55.720
Why does everyone know about it?

29:55.740 --> 29:57.060
Besides us,

29:57.060 --> 29:58.860
only Second Prince knows about this.

29:58.980 --> 30:00.620
Did His Highness spread the news?

30:00.780 --> 30:04.380
I don't understand what he's after.

30:15.300 --> 30:17.500
I remember that your house is nearby.

30:17.500 --> 30:18.780
Whose house is this?

30:19.020 --> 30:20.200
This is mine too.

30:20.220 --> 30:21.780
Is it under your name?

30:21.820 --> 30:23.020
No.

30:23.540 --> 30:24.620
Mr. Fan,

30:24.700 --> 30:26.100
make yourself at home.

30:27.225 --> 30:28.240
The original owner

30:28.260 --> 30:29.840
of this house was a gardener.

30:29.860 --> 30:31.380
He borrowed money from me.

30:31.780 --> 30:32.640
In the end,

30:32.660 --> 30:35.760
he gave the house to me
after his business failed.

30:35.780 --> 30:37.380
Take a guess at what this is.

30:38.020 --> 30:39.780
Isn't that an ordinary kiln?

30:46.860 --> 30:49.480
This is actually the back door.

30:49.500 --> 30:50.580
I dug a tunnel

30:50.580 --> 30:52.200
and it's connected directly
to the house.

30:52.220 --> 30:54.240
Even if someone were to bother me,

30:54.260 --> 30:56.700
I could enter
and exit the house at will.

31:00.660 --> 31:02.740
The world was shocked
by Fan Xian's death.

31:02.780 --> 31:03.780
At this moment,

31:03.780 --> 31:06.300
if we manage to find him in the Capital,

31:06.940 --> 31:09.180
his crime of deceiving the ruler

31:09.780 --> 31:11.780
will be confirmed.

31:19.660 --> 31:21.520
I've already set up a trap

31:21.540 --> 31:23.440
near Wang Qinian's house.

31:23.460 --> 31:25.040
As soon as Fan Xian shows up,

31:25.060 --> 31:27.320
he'll never be able
to escape from you, Your Highness.

31:27.340 --> 31:29.080
Wang Qinian is Fan Xian's trusted aide.

31:29.100 --> 31:30.620
And he lived in the Capital
for many years.

31:30.640 --> 31:31.980
Fan Xian has no one else

31:32.340 --> 31:34.100
to depend on except for him.

31:37.420 --> 31:38.720
Mr. Fan, look.

31:38.740 --> 31:40.580
Look at the roads outside.

31:40.780 --> 31:41.840
They extend in all directions.

31:41.860 --> 31:43.520
And they all lead to places
outside the city.

31:43.540 --> 31:45.000
If we do get ourselves in trouble,

31:45.020 --> 31:46.480
it's convenient for us to escape.

31:46.500 --> 31:49.100
Not bad at all. This is a haven.

31:49.860 --> 31:51.580
Haven, huh?

31:52.740 --> 31:54.320
That's a fitting name.

31:54.340 --> 31:56.500
But there's
the Imperial Inspectorate too.

31:57.100 --> 31:59.420
Fan Xian is an inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

31:59.440 --> 32:01.420
If he returns
to the Imperial Inspectorate,

32:01.740 --> 32:04.020
it'll be more than just a crime
of deceiving the ruler.

32:04.540 --> 32:06.020
If that's the case,

32:06.100 --> 32:07.780
the victor of this round

32:08.980 --> 32:10.340
will be decided.

32:12.700 --> 32:13.689
I don't remember

32:13.690 --> 32:16.180
that the Imperial Inspectorate
has such a habit.

32:17.100 --> 32:18.340
Initially,

32:18.460 --> 32:20.180
this habit didn't exist.

32:20.660 --> 32:21.920
But Mr. Fan, ever since

32:21.940 --> 32:24.160
I was lucky enough to encounter you,

32:24.180 --> 32:27.180
you made my world a warm place.

32:27.940 --> 32:29.780
However, I have to live in anticipation

32:29.820 --> 32:31.720
of thrilling events every day.

32:31.740 --> 32:32.820
Here, Mr. Fan.

32:33.780 --> 32:34.860
Have a seat.

32:39.580 --> 32:41.240
But since we have a haven here,

32:41.260 --> 32:42.960
it's not like we have
to go to your residence.

32:42.980 --> 32:44.320
We can stay here.

32:44.340 --> 32:45.740
No, Mr. Fan.

32:46.020 --> 32:48.840
My wife was the one

32:48.860 --> 32:51.780
who helped the Teng family settle down.

32:52.020 --> 32:53.580
If we want to find them,

32:53.660 --> 32:55.540
we still have to return to my residence

32:55.780 --> 32:58.100
and see my wife.

32:59.260 --> 33:00.340
Wang.

33:00.460 --> 33:01.940
We can go during nighttime.

33:02.080 --> 33:03.540
We should be more cautious.

33:04.540 --> 33:06.300
Restrain yourself.

33:09.100 --> 33:11.620
Close your doors and windows!

33:11.940 --> 33:14.700
Prevent both fire and theft!

33:16.740 --> 33:19.260
Close your doors and windows!

33:19.340 --> 33:22.180
Prevent both fire and theft!

33:32.260 --> 33:34.460
It's good to be home.

33:40.540 --> 33:42.300
What's going on? Is there an assassin?

33:44.580 --> 33:47.700
I told my wife to prepare this
for the crooks.

33:49.100 --> 33:50.020
But speaking of which,

33:50.020 --> 33:51.020
I never expected the well

33:51.020 --> 33:52.380
to be our exit.

33:54.260 --> 33:56.020
My wife might be asleep.

33:56.300 --> 33:58.000
Don't wake her.

33:58.020 --> 34:00.380
If not, she'll throw a terrible tantrum.

34:00.820 --> 34:02.860
Let's head to that room.

34:04.540 --> 34:05.920
If that's the case,

34:05.940 --> 34:08.340
why don't we just return to the haven?

34:10.260 --> 34:13.300
That's where my daughter lives.

34:14.180 --> 34:15.520
I've been out for so long.

34:15.540 --> 34:17.580
I want to go and check on her.

34:17.600 --> 34:18.160
Let's go.

34:18.180 --> 34:19.260
Fine.

34:27.660 --> 34:28.740
Here.

34:29.580 --> 34:30.980
It's laced with knives.

34:31.220 --> 34:32.500
Step over it.

34:38.540 --> 34:39.700
There's more.

34:39.780 --> 34:40.860
Here.

34:41.140 --> 34:41.800
Here.

34:41.820 --> 34:43.180
And there.

34:43.420 --> 34:45.500
There are deer traps.

34:45.820 --> 34:47.340
Step here and you'll be fine.

34:54.260 --> 34:56.780
My wife changed the trap placement.

34:57.820 --> 34:58.760
Mr. Fan.

34:58.780 --> 35:01.780
Why don't I carry you on my back?

35:48.340 --> 35:50.860
Is your father Wang Qinian?

35:52.180 --> 35:53.360
I'm a good friend of his.

35:53.380 --> 35:54.780
You can call me Mister.

35:57.380 --> 35:58.460
Is it for me?

36:00.780 --> 36:02.100
Thank you so much.

36:16.340 --> 36:17.700
The congee is ready.

36:17.820 --> 36:19.060
The congee is ready.

36:19.980 --> 36:21.700
Mother is asking you to eat.

36:22.700 --> 36:23.780
Okay.

36:36.900 --> 36:38.260
[The Wife of Wang Qinian]
You must be Mr. Fan.

36:38.260 --> 36:39.760
I'm Qinian's wife.

36:39.780 --> 36:40.960
Please don't call me Mr. Fan.

36:40.980 --> 36:42.260
Wang and I are sworn brothers.

36:42.260 --> 36:44.460
I should call you
my sister-in-law instead.

36:45.300 --> 36:46.620
Mr. Fan, please have a seat.

36:48.700 --> 36:50.840
Qinian went out in the morning
to run the errands for you.

36:50.860 --> 36:52.420
We don't need to wait for him.

36:53.060 --> 36:54.280
He was insensible.

36:54.300 --> 36:56.600
He only told me
about your arrival this morning.

36:56.620 --> 36:58.180
I had no time to prepare anything.

36:58.200 --> 36:59.180
I could only make some congee.

36:59.180 --> 37:00.000
Mr. Fan, sorry about that.

37:00.000 --> 37:00.880
Please don't say that.

37:00.900 --> 37:02.420
Madam, I'm the one troubling you.

37:06.300 --> 37:07.460
There's meat!

37:08.780 --> 37:10.100
That's great.

37:10.300 --> 37:11.140
What's your name?

37:11.140 --> 37:12.800
Baba.
[*It sounds like Father in Mandarin]

37:16.780 --> 37:17.800
I didn't teach her that.

37:17.820 --> 37:18.880
Mr. Fan, you misunderstood her.

37:18.900 --> 37:20.300
That's her pet name.

37:20.860 --> 37:23.740
My daughter's name is Ba,
a single Chinese character.

37:23.860 --> 37:25.720
May I know which character it is?

37:25.740 --> 37:27.460
Ba, as in domineering aura.

37:30.220 --> 37:31.780
That scared me.

37:32.620 --> 37:35.740
Mister, your egg fell.

37:36.340 --> 37:37.620
Thanks.

37:39.740 --> 37:43.060
Mr. Fan, I heard you had
dozens of relationships here.

37:44.740 --> 37:46.180
I swear to the heavens
that it's not true.

37:46.180 --> 37:47.760
It's fake. They are all rumors.

37:47.780 --> 37:48.840
Not even one?

37:48.860 --> 37:49.540
Not even one.

37:49.540 --> 37:51.060
What about Her Highness, then?

37:52.980 --> 37:54.800
My engagement with Wan'er was real.

37:54.820 --> 37:56.900
However,
all of the other rumors are fake.

37:57.980 --> 37:59.740
Mr. Fan, I trust you.

37:59.980 --> 38:01.220
Please have your meal.

38:03.620 --> 38:05.940
Mister, don't let it fall again.

38:08.860 --> 38:10.140
I'll try my best.

38:18.340 --> 38:21.620
Your daughter's name is quite special.

38:24.540 --> 38:27.740
Qinian chose the name
when I first got pregnant.

38:27.980 --> 38:29.920
We didn't expect it to be a girl.

38:29.940 --> 38:31.240
If so, why didn't you change her name?

38:31.260 --> 38:33.680
A tough name will make her tough.

38:33.700 --> 38:34.880
She can grow up peacefully.

38:34.900 --> 38:36.600
That's a great name
with a great meaning.

38:36.620 --> 38:38.700
I also think my name is great.

38:46.260 --> 38:47.940
Mother, I know my fault now.

38:47.940 --> 38:49.340
"When eating, do not converse;
when in bed, do not speak."

38:49.340 --> 38:52.060
I shouldn't speak while eating.

38:53.900 --> 38:55.560
You should make amends, then.

38:55.580 --> 38:58.260
I know now. I'll surely make amends.

38:59.180 --> 39:00.260
Get up now.

39:02.540 --> 39:03.860
Mr. Fan, please have a seat.

39:13.440 --> 39:14.820
I was disciplining my child.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.520
Mr. Fan, please make yourself at home.

39:28.660 --> 39:29.740
Chief.

39:30.860 --> 39:31.880
Where's Yan Ruohai?

39:31.900 --> 39:33.580
He locked himself away.

39:37.940 --> 39:39.280
Let's go and check on him.

39:42.100 --> 39:43.120
Mr. Fan, just leave it here.

39:43.140 --> 39:44.620
Let me help you out.

39:44.820 --> 39:47.860
Mr. Fan, I heard from Qinian
that you were paying rent.

39:49.540 --> 39:51.220
Did he say that?

39:51.780 --> 39:53.180
He said you were paying us
one liang per day

39:53.180 --> 39:54.520
to cover our expenses.

39:54.540 --> 39:55.440
Isn't that the case?

39:55.460 --> 39:57.200
It is the case.

39:57.220 --> 39:58.460
I have to pay my rent.

39:58.780 --> 40:01.740
If so, there's no reason
for you to work, Mr. Fan.

40:01.860 --> 40:04.300
Otherwise, it'll be inappropriate
to take your money.

40:04.820 --> 40:06.200
Mr. Fan, please have a seat.

40:07.780 --> 40:09.620
Baba, chat with Mister.

40:15.540 --> 40:16.980
What should we chat about?

40:17.260 --> 40:18.340
Anything's fine.

40:18.820 --> 40:20.100
How old are you?

40:20.140 --> 40:22.340
I'm five years old. What about you?

40:23.220 --> 40:24.840
I'm much older than you.

40:24.860 --> 40:26.500
If so, are you an adult?

40:26.780 --> 40:27.760
Of course.

40:27.780 --> 40:30.060
Why did you sleep on my bed, then?

40:33.140 --> 40:35.300
I'm just living here for the time being.

40:35.820 --> 40:37.760
Do you like meat, then?

40:37.780 --> 40:38.760
I do.

40:38.780 --> 40:40.960
Do you know
what's the best kind of meat, then?

40:40.980 --> 40:41.800
What is it?

40:41.820 --> 40:43.580
It's pork belly.

40:45.340 --> 40:46.200
You have a point.

40:46.220 --> 40:47.880
If so, do you want
to have some pork belly?

40:47.900 --> 40:48.720
I do.

40:48.740 --> 40:49.860
Mother!

40:52.300 --> 40:53.380
What's the matter?

40:53.540 --> 40:55.620
Mister wants to have some pork belly.

40:56.940 --> 40:58.620
Mr. Fan, I'll prepare some for dinner.

40:59.420 --> 41:01.060
It wasn't me. I didn't...

41:04.420 --> 41:07.240
Well, you're pretty crafty, aren't you?

41:07.260 --> 41:08.520
Can you do me a favor?

41:08.540 --> 41:09.620
Okay.

41:09.820 --> 41:10.840
Do you have any papers at home?

41:10.860 --> 41:12.940
Get me a piece
of burnt charcoal stick too.

41:16.700 --> 41:19.260
Baba does take after her father.

41:21.260 --> 41:24.180
Wang Qinian's tracks
have been discovered within the city.

41:25.940 --> 41:28.700
Chief, seems like
your prediction was spot-on.

41:28.820 --> 41:30.300
Fan Xian isn't dead.

41:30.380 --> 41:31.820
He even came to the Capital.

41:33.140 --> 41:34.600
So,

41:34.620 --> 41:37.520
will you wait for Fan Xian
to come and see you here?

41:37.540 --> 41:39.580
He can't come here.

41:39.740 --> 41:42.120
The Imperial Inspectorate
is above all officials.

41:42.140 --> 41:44.200
It's also the most important place
in the Qing State.

41:44.220 --> 41:47.700
If he abused his power as an inspector

41:47.820 --> 41:49.400
for the sake of his personal affairs,

41:49.420 --> 41:50.780
he'll be executed for sure.

41:51.580 --> 41:54.700
Didn't you say that His Majesty
was already enraged?

41:56.140 --> 41:58.460
He deceived the ruler
by faking his death.

42:00.460 --> 42:02.260
That warrants the death penalty as well.

42:03.340 --> 42:04.780
He'll be executed

42:04.820 --> 42:06.180
no matter what he does.

42:08.060 --> 42:10.140
If so, how are you
still in the mood for congee?

42:11.140 --> 42:12.900
I've already done everything I could.

42:15.620 --> 42:16.740
Can it save him?

42:16.900 --> 42:18.820
He's the only person
who can save himself.

42:21.140 --> 42:24.260
What if Fan Xian fails this time around?

42:25.780 --> 42:27.900
If he fails,

42:27.980 --> 42:30.620
I'm afraid you have
to stay here forever.

42:33.060 --> 42:34.620
I'm not that important.

42:35.100 --> 42:36.780
You're the key here.

42:38.700 --> 42:40.460
What will you do

42:41.340 --> 42:42.700
if Fan Xian dies?

42:50.980 --> 42:53.740
If Fan Xian ends up dead,

42:55.460 --> 42:57.740
many people will join him
in the afterlife.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.638
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.658 --> 44:10.898
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
